00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:10.240
what I mean by that is that I think that
the first step in manage managing time

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:15.340
other than keeping track of your time
like you were talking about I when I

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:18.490
gave classes on that and when I'm
