00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:18.520
history and I go wait a minute six hours
a day yeah because I'm failing in it I

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:23.620
go well it's very possible that you're
spending too much time not too little

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:29.770
time because what happens during those
six hours is probably not the most

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:36.040
productive way of studying history and
we would rearrange their pattern so that

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:39.400
they would actually study history only
one hour a day but do it in an

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:47.320
uninterrupted way and and here's what
