00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:04.750
phone rings that I have to take it or
the house burned down that I have to

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:09.120
deal with that then I will turn off the
stopwatch until that particular

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:12.940
interruption is over with and then I'll
go back until I get my hour and a half

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:17.410
on the stopwatch and it doesn't matter
you know whether you're doing it 3:00

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:23.470
p.m. or 3:00 a.m. or 8:00 p.m. etc as
