00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:29.140
the stopwatch you are you know you're in
good shape so sometimes I have three or

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:33.700
four stop watches around depending on
what project I'm applying them to and of

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:39.400
course I've got my computer stopwatch
and I really look at the time except if

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:43.750
there's an appointment or something that
I have to be aware of because I'm really

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:48.670
focused on you know my time which is the
soft watches time and that's what I need

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:53.830
to be focused on if I want to you know
be in that unique category of people who

00:10:53.830 --> 00:11:00.070
create things and in my case manage
people create things so you mentioned a

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:04.810
conversation you had about work and how
it's good work or bad work has never

