00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:10.550
time and then there's a type P
personality who never is very well

00:12:10.550 --> 00:12:17.540
defined and and somehow doesn't become
an ideal SL yeh describes him but is

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:22.940
somebody who's well adjusted and doesn't
